---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout
  title="Website Privacy | 5VA Appliance Repair"
  description="How the 5VA Appliance Repair website handles appliance details, calls, text messages, Google Maps, and customer review information."
>
  <section class="page-hero">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="breadcrumb">
        <a href="/">Home</a>
        <span>/</span>
        <span>Privacy</span>
      </div>
      <h1>
        Your details
        <br />
        Handled with care
      </h1>
      <p class="lead">Privacy information for this website. Last updated October 25, 2026.</p>
    </div>
  </section>
  <section class="section">
    <div class="container prose" style="max-width:800px">
      <h2>Information you choose to share</h2>
      <p>
        Contact 5VA directly by calling or texting +1 (267) 704-8588. This website has no inquiry
        form and does not collect your name, ZIP code or appliance description through website
        fields. Calls and messages use your own telephone or messaging provider.
      </p>
      <h2>How service information is used</h2>
      <p>
        Information you send to the business is used to respond to your inquiry, clarify the job,
        and arrange requested services. Send only details relevant to the repair. Please keep
        payment information, access codes, and sensitive documents out of an initial inquiry.
      </p>
      <h2>Website storage and measurement</h2>
      <p>
        The website has no customer accounts or inquiry forms and does not store appliance details
        in your browser. Google call-measurement tags do not load until you allow them. We remember
        only your measurement choice and its date in local browser storage for up to 180 days. The
        hosting provider may process ordinary technical access logs, such as IP addresses and
        request times.
      </p>
      <h2>Optional Google ad-call measurement</h2>
      <p>
        If you choose “Allow call measurement”, Google’s tag may receive your IP address, device
        information and page URL, including advertising click information, and use advertising
        cookies or browser storage. For eligible visits from Google ads, Google may show a
        forwarding phone number that connects to 5VA. This helps measure calls and their duration; a
        call must last at least 60 seconds to count as this website’s Google Ads call conversion. A
        phone-button click alone does not confirm a connected call or an appointment.
      </p>
      <p>
        This optional setup is not used for personalized advertising or enhanced conversions. Text
        messages always go directly to +1 (267) 704-8588 and are not measured by the Google call
        tag. Calls and texts remain available if you decline, if a forwarding number is unavailable,
        or if the tag is blocked. This does not measure every organic visit or every call to the
        business.
      </p>
      <p>
        Open “Privacy choices” in the footer to change your decision. Turning measurement off
        restores the business number, clears known first-party measurement storage where your
        browser allows and reloads the page without the Google tag. This cannot erase information
        already sent to Google or remove cookies held on Google’s own domains. Google’s privacy
        practices apply to its services. Your choice is optional and does not affect access to
        repair services.
      </p>
      <h2>Google Maps and reviews</h2>
      <p>
        Selected short review excerpts are displayed with their authors and a link to the original
        Google listing. The displayed rating and count include a check date. Google Maps is
        available through external links; this website does not embed or load a Google map. Opening
        a Google link takes you to its service, where Google’s own privacy practices apply.
      </p>
      <h2>Images and fonts</h2>
      <p>
        Website images and fonts are served with the site. Photos in the home page work gallery come
        from the business’s Google profile. Blog covers are illustrative design imagery and are not
        presented as photographs of completed customer jobs or company staff.
      </p>
      <h2>Questions and requests</h2>
      <p>
        For questions about information you have shared with 5VA, call{' '}
        <a href="tel:+12677048588">+1 (267) 704-8588</a>. Please describe your inquiry so the
        business can identify the relevant conversation.
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>
</Layout>
